    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "models/gemini-2.5-flash",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "models/gemini-2.5-flash"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "={{ $('Webhook from Line Message').item.json.body.events[0].message.text }}"
            },
            {
              "content": "=你是一個幫我解析點餐需求的助手。\n\n餐點欄位名稱舉例：\n- Dish_ID\n- Dish_Name\n- Price\n- Description\n- Main_Ingredients\n- Tags\n- Category\n- Portion_Type\n- Suggested_Persons\n- Priority_Score\n\n使用者會說例如：\n- 我不想吃豬肉\n- 兩個人吃，預算 300 以內\n- 不要太辣，幫我推薦幾道菜\n\n請你只輸出一個 JSON，格式如下（範例）：\n\n{\n  \"filters\": [\n    {\n      \"field\": \"Main_Ingredients\",\n      \"operator\": \"EXCLUDES\",\n      \"values\": [\"豬肉\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"field\": \"Price\",\n      \"operator\": \"<=\",\n      \"value\": 300\n    },\n    {\n      \"field\": \"Suggested_Persons\",\n      \"operator\": \"==\",\n      \"value\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"field\": \"Tags\",\n      \"operator\": \"EXCLUDES\",\n      \"values\": [\"辣\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"sortBy\": \"Priority_Score\",\n  \"sortOrder\": \"DESC\",\n  \"limit\": 5\n}\n\noperator 可以是：\n- \"==\", \"!=\", \"<\", \"<=\", \">\", \">=\"\n- \"INCLUDES\": 文字/陣列中包含任一 values\n- \"EXCLUDES\": 文字/陣列中不包含任何 values\n\n請務必回傳合法 JSON，不要加 ```，不要多餘說明。\n",
              "role": "model"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": "={{ true }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        96,
